### ============================================================
### Pruebas Flowable REST – Peluditos Pet Chile (Entrega 1)
### Usar con la extensión "REST Client" de VS Code (botón "Send Request")
### ============================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/flowable-rest
# rest-admin:test en Base64
@authorization = Basic cmVzdC1hZG1pbjp0ZXN0

### 1) ¿Está vivo el motor?
GET {{baseUrl}}/service/management/engine
Authorization: {{authorization}}
Accept: application/json

### 2) Desplegar el BPMN mínimo
POST {{baseUrl}}/service/repository/deployments
Authorization: {{authorization}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="gestion-lead-minimo.bpmn20.xml"
Content-Type: application/xml

< ../BPMN/gestion-lead-minimo.bpmn20.xml
------Boundary--

### 3) Ver definiciones de proceso desplegadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/service/repository/process-definitions?key=gestionLead
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### 4) Iniciar una instancia (llega una consulta por Instagram)
POST {{baseUrl}}/service/runtime/process-instances
Authorization: {{authorization}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "processDefinitionKey": "gestionLead",
  "businessKey": "LEAD-0001",
  "variables": [
    { "name": "nombre",   "value": "María González" },
    { "name": "telefono", "value": "+56911111111" },
    { "name": "canal",    "value": "instagram" },
    { "name": "interes",  "value": "Torta mediana para perro" }
  ]
}

### 5) Bandeja de tareas (copiar el "id" de la tarea "Registrar lead")
GET {{baseUrl}}/service/runtime/tasks?processDefinitionKey=gestionLead
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### 6) Completar "Registrar lead"
@taskRegistrar = PEGAR-ID-TAREA
POST {{baseUrl}}/service/runtime/tasks/{{taskRegistrar}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "complete",
  "variables": [
    { "name": "correo", "value": "maria@example.com" }
  ]
}

### 7) Volver a consultar la bandeja (ahora aparece "Realizar seguimiento")
GET {{baseUrl}}/service/runtime/tasks?processDefinitionKey=gestionLead
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### 8) Completar "Realizar seguimiento" indicando si compró
@taskSeguimiento = PEGAR-ID-TAREA
POST {{baseUrl}}/service/runtime/tasks/{{taskSeguimiento}}
Authorization: {{authorization}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "complete",
  "variables": [
    { "name": "compro", "type": "boolean", "value": true }
  ]
}

### 9) Historial: ver por qué fin terminó la instancia (finConvertido / finNoConvertido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/service/history/historic-activity-instances?processDefinitionId=PEGAR-PROCESS-DEFINITION-ID&activityType=endEvent
Authorization: {{authorization}}

### 10) Instancias históricas terminadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/service/history/historic-process-instances?processDefinitionKey=gestionLead&finished=true
Authorization: {{authorization}}
